#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:5
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "音频"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:7
msgid ""
"This guide covers the audio endpoints exposed through AIBrix's gateway: "
"text-to-speech, in single and batch form, and speech-to-text through "
"transcription and translation. The :ref:`supported endpoints <multimodal-"
"supported-endpoints>` table shows which audio endpoints each engine "
"offers and which of them AIBrix supports. Before you start, finish the "
":ref:`prerequisites <omni-prerequisites>` and :ref:`gateway access <omni-"
"access-gateway>` steps on the Multi-Modal Serving page, and deploy your "
"model the way the :ref:`video guide <omni-video-deploy>` describes, "
"swapping in an audio model."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍通过 AIBrix 网关提供的音频端点：文本转语音（单条和批量形式），以及通过转写和翻译实现的语音转文本。 :ref:`支持的端点 "
"<multimodal-supported-endpoints>` 表显示了各引擎提供哪些音频端点，以及 AIBrix "
"支持其中哪些。开始之前，请先完成多模态服务页面上的 :ref:`前置条件 <omni-prerequisites>` 和 :ref:`访问网关 "
"<omni-access-gateway>` 步骤，并按照 :ref:`视频指南 <omni-video-deploy>` "
"所述方式部署模型，换成音频模型。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:10
msgid ""
"A text+audio example (`Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B "
"<https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B>`_) lives at "
"`samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml>`_ in the"
" AIBrix repository."
msgstr ""
"文本 + 音频示例（ `Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B <https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5"
"-Omni-7B>`_ ）位于 AIBrix 仓库的 `samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml "
"<https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:15
msgid "Text-to-Speech"
msgstr "文本转语音"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:17
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/audio/speech`` synthesizes speech from text. It is a JSON "
"request with a binary audio response, so — like the image and synchronous"
" video endpoints — it needs none of the video job machinery: the gateway "
"routes it to the pods of the requested model and streams the audio back "
"untouched."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/audio/speech`` 将文本合成为语音。它是 JSON "
"请求、二进制音频响应，因此——与图像和同步视频端点一样——不需要任何视频任务机制：网关会将其路由到所请求模型的 Pod，并把音频原样流式返回。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:32
msgid "What differs from the other endpoints:"
msgstr "与其他端点不同之处："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:34
msgid ""
"``model`` is required. The gateway needs the name to select a pod, so a "
"request without one is rejected with ``400``."
msgstr "``model`` 为必填项。网关需要模型名来选择 Pod，因此缺少该字段的请求会以 ``400`` 被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:35
msgid ""
"``input`` is required and cannot be empty. It is the text to synthesize "
"and is also the routing text for prefix-cache-aware routing."
msgstr "``input`` 为必填项且不能为空，是要合成的文本，同时也是前缀缓存感知路由使用的路由文本。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:36
msgid ""
"Every other field, such as ``voice``, ``response_format``, ``speed``, "
"``instructions``, ``language``, and ``stream_format``, is forwarded as "
"sent and validated by the engine."
msgstr ""
"其他字段，例如 ``voice`` 、 ``response_format`` 、 ``speed`` 、 ``instructions`` 、 "
"``language`` 和 ``stream_format`` ，都会原样转发，由引擎校验。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:37
msgid ""
"The response is binary audio, which the engine may send in several "
"chunks. The gateway forwards it byte for byte and never parses it as JSON"
" or as an SSE stream, so a request-level ``stream`` field does not turn "
"on SSE handling. Nothing about a successful body is parsed, so no token "
"usage is reported."
msgstr ""
"响应为二进制音频，引擎可能分多个分块发送。网关逐字节转发，绝不将其解析为 JSON 或 SSE 流，因此请求级的 ``stream`` "
"字段不会开启 SSE 处理。成功响应体不会被解析，因此不上报 token 用量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:38
msgid ""
"Unlike the ``/v1/videos`` endpoints, this one takes ``application/json``:"
" do **not** send ``multipart/form-data``."
msgstr ""
"与 ``/v1/videos`` 各端点不同，此端点接收 ``application/json`` ：请 **不要** 发送 "
"``multipart/form-data`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:43
msgid "Batch Text-to-Speech"
msgstr "批量文本转语音"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:45
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/audio/speech/batch`` synthesizes several utterances in one "
"call. The request is shared defaults plus an ``items`` array whose "
"entries override them, and the response is **one JSON document** with a "
"base64-encoded result per item — not binary audio. The gateway routes it "
"to the pods of the requested model like ``/v1/audio/speech``; it needs no"
" new route, because the ``/v1/audio/speech`` path match already covers "
"it."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/audio/speech/batch`` 一次调用合成多段语音。请求由共享的默认值加上一个 ``items`` "
"数组组成，数组中的条目会覆盖这些默认值；响应是 **一个 JSON 文档** ，其中每个条目对应一个 base64 "
"编码的结果——而不是二进制音频。网关像处理 ``/v1/audio/speech`` 一样将其路由到所请求模型的 Pod；无需新增路由，因为 "
"``/v1/audio/speech`` 的路径匹配已经覆盖了它。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:66
msgid "What the gateway checks, and returns ``400`` for:"
msgstr "网关会检查以下内容，不满足时返回 ``400`` ："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:68
msgid ""
"The body must be a JSON object, and ``model`` is required, for the same "
"reason as ``/v1/audio/speech``."
msgstr "请求体必须是 JSON 对象，且 ``model`` 为必填项，原因与 ``/v1/audio/speech`` 相同。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:69
msgid ""
"``items`` is required and cannot be empty, and every entry must be a JSON"
" object. The error's ``param`` names the entry, such as ``items.2``."
msgstr ""
"``items`` 为必填项且不能为空，每个条目都必须是 JSON 对象。错误中的 ``param`` 会指明具体条目，例如 "
"``items.2`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:71
msgid ""
"Everything inside an item (``input``, ``voice``, ``speed``, "
"``ref_audio``, ``ref_text``, ...) is forwarded as sent and validated by "
"the engine, and so is the number of items. The engine reports a bad item "
"as a failed entry in an otherwise successful response, so one bad item "
"does not fail the batch:"
msgstr ""
"条目内部的内容（ ``input`` 、 ``voice`` 、 ``speed`` 、 ``ref_audio`` 、 ``ref_text``"
" 等）以及条目数量，都会原样转发，由引擎校验。引擎会把有问题的条目作为失败项放入整体成功的响应中，因此单个坏条目不会让整个批次失败："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:86
msgid "Things to know when calling it through the gateway:"
msgstr "通过网关调用时需要注意："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:88
msgid ""
"The HTTP status is ``200`` even when items fail. Check ``failed`` or each"
" result's ``status``; the gateway does not parse the body, so its metrics"
" cannot see per-item failures."
msgstr ""
"即使有条目失败，HTTP 状态码也是 ``200`` 。请检查 ``failed`` 或每个结果的 ``status`` "
"；网关不会解析响应体，因此其指标无法看到单个条目的失败。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:89
msgid ""
"Results follow the order of ``items``, and ``index`` is the entry's "
"position in your request."
msgstr "结果与 ``items`` 的顺序一致， ``index`` 是该条目在你的请求中的位置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:90
msgid ""
"The response is forwarded as it arrives and never parsed as JSON or SSE, "
"so no token usage is reported. A request-level ``stream`` field does not "
"turn on SSE handling, and the engine refuses ``stream`` on an item."
msgstr ""
"响应按到达情况原样转发，绝不解析为 JSON 或 SSE，因此不上报 token 用量。请求级的 ``stream`` 字段不会开启 SSE "
"处理，引擎也会拒绝条目上的 ``stream`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:91
msgid ""
"The request body is buffered by the gateway, and the default connection "
"buffer limit is 4 MiB (``bufferLimit``). Give each reference clip as a "
"URL rather than an inline base64 data URL, and keep batches small enough "
"that the response, which inlines every item's audio as base64, stays "
"within what your clients accept."
msgstr ""
"网关会缓冲请求体，默认连接缓冲上限为 4 MiB（ ``bufferLimit`` ）。请以 URL 而不是内联 base64 data URL "
"的方式提供每个参考音频，并控制批次大小，使内联了每个条目 base64 音频的响应不超过客户端可接受的范围。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:96
msgid "Transcription and Translation"
msgstr "转写与翻译"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:98
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/audio/transcriptions`` and ``POST /v1/audio/translations`` are"
" the OpenAI-style speech-to-text endpoints, served only for models that "
"support the task. Unlike text-to-speech they take ``multipart/form-data``"
" with the audio in a ``file`` part, so — like the ``/v1/videos`` "
"endpoints — do **not** set ``-H \"Content-Type: application/json\"``."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/audio/transcriptions`` 和 ``POST /v1/audio/translations`` 是 "
"OpenAI 风格的语音转文本端点，仅对支持该任务的模型提供服务。与文本转语音不同，它们接收 ``multipart/form-data`` "
"，音频放在 ``file`` 部分，因此——与 ``/v1/videos`` 各端点一样—— **不要** 设置 ``-H \"Content-"
"Type: application/json\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:107
msgid "What the gateway checks:"
msgstr "网关会检查以下内容："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:109
msgid ""
"``model`` is required as a form field. The gateway needs the name to "
"select a pod, so a request without one is rejected with ``400``."
msgstr "``model`` 必须作为表单字段提供。网关需要模型名来选择 Pod，因此缺少该字段的请求会以 ``400`` 被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:110
msgid ""
"A JSON body is rejected with ``400`` and the message ``audio requests "
"must use multipart/form-data content-type``."
msgstr ""
"JSON 请求体会以 ``400`` 被拒绝，消息为 ``audio requests must use multipart/form-data "
"content-type`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:111
msgid ""
"Every other field, including the ``file`` part, is forwarded as sent and "
"validated by the engine."
msgstr "其他字段（包括 ``file`` 部分）都会原样转发，由引擎校验。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:112
msgid ""
"A ``stream`` form field set to ``true`` or ``1`` makes the gateway handle"
" the response as an SSE stream."
msgstr "将 ``stream`` 表单字段设为 ``true`` 或 ``1`` ，网关会把响应作为 SSE 流处理。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:113
msgid ""
"The whole request, audio file included, counts against the gateway's "
"request size limit, 4 MiB by default; see Message Size Configuration in "
":doc:`gateway-plugins`."
msgstr "整个请求（包括音频文件）计入网关的请求大小上限，默认 4 MiB；参见 :doc:`gateway-plugins` 中的消息大小配置。"

