#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:129
msgid "``/v1/audio/speech``"
msgstr "``/v1/audio/speech``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:130
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:133
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:136
msgid "POST"
msgstr "POST"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:131
msgid ""
"JSON request, binary audio response. Routed by model like a chat "
"completion; the audio streams through unparsed, so no token usage is "
"recorded and no job is registered."
msgstr ""
"JSON 请求、二进制音频响应。像 chat completion 一样按模型路由；音频不经解析直接流式转发，因此不记录 token "
"用量，也不登记任务。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:132
msgid "``/v1/audio/speech/batch``"
msgstr "``/v1/audio/speech/batch``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:134
msgid ""
"JSON request with an ``items`` array, one JSON response holding a base64 "
"result per item. Routed by model; the gateway checks only ``model`` and "
"``items``, the response streams through unparsed, and ``200`` does not "
"mean every item succeeded."
msgstr ""
"JSON 请求，带有 ``items`` 数组，返回一个 JSON 响应，其中包含每个条目的 base64 结果。按模型路由；网关只检查 "
"``model`` 和 ``items`` ，响应不经解析直接流式转发，且 ``200`` 并不表示每个条目都成功。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:135
msgid "``/v1/audio/transcriptions``, ``/v1/audio/translations``"
msgstr "``/v1/audio/transcriptions``, ``/v1/audio/translations``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-audio.rst:137
msgid ""
"``multipart/form-data`` request with the model in a ``model`` form field."
" Routed by model; a ``stream`` form field set to ``true`` or ``1`` makes "
"the response an SSE stream."
msgstr ""
"``multipart/form-data`` 请求，模型放在 ``model`` 表单字段中。按模型路由； ``stream`` 表单字段设为 "
"``true`` 或 ``1`` 时，响应按 SSE 流处理。"

